<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-CHICAGO BULLS WIN NBA CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-CHICAGO BULLS WIN NBA CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Bulls defeated the Utah Jazz 90-86 on Friday to win the National Basketball Association championship.</p>
<p>The Bulls won the best-of-seven title series four games to two.</p>
